  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season the chicken breast with salt and pepper.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet and cook the chicken until browned.",
    "Transfer the chicken to the oven and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "In a small bowl, mix the coconut milk and lime juice.",
    "Shred the cooked chicken and mix with the coconut milk mixture.",
    "Assemble the ssam wraps with the chicken mixture and brazilian cheese.",
    "Bake the wraps in the oven for 5 minutes or until the cheese is melted and gooey.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
